    "description": [
      "Partially covered by a canvas sailcloth, the bow-shaped balcony is overgrown with greenery.  Vines loop about brass railings and around flowering shrubs, and a carpet of brocade moss covers all but a small koa-and-seaglass pathway, its springy turf ranging from almost black where the shadows hang heavy to a lighter hue beneath the moonlight.  A few herbs cluster near a koa-inlaid glass door leading inside, but the focus is on flowers and lush, tropical vegetation.  Almost hidden beneath the vines is a small, nondescript statue of a mermaid."
